{
    "id":  26451,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Solar LED Street Light EcoUrban 120 SMD2835 3CCT 1800Lm | PIR Sensor + Remote Control | IP65",
    "reference":  "SGDS120W-3CCT-91564",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban Circular Solar LED Street Light 120W SMD2835 Ø45cm\u003c/strong\u003e combines modern 360º design, energy efficiency, and high performance. \u003cstrong\u003e3CCT selectable (3000K / 4000K / 6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e, offers up to \u003cstrong\u003e1800 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e. Incorporates \u003cstrong\u003ePIR motion sensor\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong\u003e15W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e12,000 mAh lithium battery\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e12 to 14 hours autonomy\u003c/strong\u003e. IP65.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eEcoUrban 120 SMD2835 Solar LED Street Light Selectable 3CCT 1800Lm | PIR Sensor + Remote Control | 360º IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban 120W Ø45cm Circular Solar LED Street Light\u003c/strong\u003e is a modern, efficient, and sustainable outdoor lighting solution designed to offer maximum performance with an elegant 360º circular lighting design. Thanks to its advanced LED technology and solar energy operation, this street light combines power, energy savings, and easy installation, making it an ideal choice for urban and residential spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-efficiency SMD2835 LEDs\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT system\u003c/strong\u003e, it allows choosing between three color temperatures: 3000K warm light, 4000K neutral light, and 6500K cold light, adapting perfectly to different environments and lighting needs. Its light output of up to 1800 lumens provides uniform, wide, and comfortable outdoor lighting, improving visibility and safety at night.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIts innovative Ø45 cm circular design allows for a homogeneous 360-degree light distribution, ideal for lighting streets, paths, gardens, squares, patios, parks, and common areas. In addition to providing functionality, its modern aesthetic fits perfectly into urban, residential, and decorative settings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe EcoUrban 120W incorporates an efficient \u003cstrong\u003ePIR motion sensor\u003c/strong\u003e with a detection area of 6 to 8 meters, allowing the lighting to be automatically activated upon detecting presence and thus optimizing energy consumption. It also includes a practical \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e, with which you can conveniently select different operating modes, light intensity, and energy-saving configurations according to the needs of each space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe solar system consists of a \u003cstrong\u003e15W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e, designed to capture maximum solar energy during the day and guarantee efficient operation even in variable conditions. The charging time is only 4-6 hours, allowing for an autonomy of more than 12-14 hours thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-capacity 12,000 mAh rechargeable lithium battery\u003c/strong\u003e. All this without the need for an electrical connection, completely reducing energy consumption and installation costs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eMade of high-quality \u003cstrong\u003eresistant ABS + PC materials\u003c/strong\u003e, this solar LED street light offers excellent resistance to impacts, wear, and prolonged outdoor exposure. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 waterproof and dustproof protection\u003c/strong\u003e guarantees reliable operation under rain, humidity, wind, dust, and other adverse weather conditions, ensuring a long useful life and minimal maintenance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended applications and uses\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe EcoUrban 120W Solar LED Street Light is perfect for multiple outdoor applications:\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eStreets and urban areas\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eGardens and parks\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003ePatios and terraces\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003ePlots and estates\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003ePaths and trails\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eHouse entrances and garages\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eNeighborhood communities\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eOutdoor parking lots\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eRecreational and pedestrian areas\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eAreas without access to the electrical grid\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to its autonomous operation through solar energy, this outdoor LED street light allows for savings on the electricity bill while contributing to environmental care. Its combination of \u003cstrong\u003epowerful lighting, motion sensor, modern 360º design, and IP65 resistance\u003c/strong\u003e makes it one of the best options for efficient and sustainable outdoor lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf you are looking for a modern, powerful, and easy-to-install circular solar LED street light, the \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban 120W Ø45cm\u003c/strong\u003e is the perfect choice to illuminate any outdoor space with style, safety, and maximum energy efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e",
